00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,524
This greedy bastard turned a five hundred dollar loan into almost two grand.

2
00:00:03,774 --> 00:00:08,231
Every payday he took a hundred fifty in fees, and your balance never moved. Not once.

3
00:00:09,081 --> 00:00:13,043
Four and a half million people got played. And he had his own damn racing team.

4
00:00:13,893 --> 00:00:20,033
Fourteen counts. Guilty. Sixteen years. Send this to the friend who never reads the fine print.
